t=\"日本頂尖名校慶應大學四年級生新澤Karen（新沢かれん，22歲）遭警視廳以竊盜及詐欺罪嫌逮捕。（YouTube@tbsnewsdig）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260818/1166389046310998016341976.jpeg/HZ_kdsbVMpYmMujguGXuo9vD9qd_YjbS7Sez6-0ns-s\"/><figcaption>日本頂尖名校慶應大學四年級生新澤Karen（新沢かれん，22歲）遭警視廳以竊盜及詐欺罪嫌逮捕。（YouTube@tbsnewsdig）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:23:57.413772+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1905,"images":17,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:00:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:22.425113+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:22.425113+00:00","content_hash":"fec4b889ec3f739a8db4487846e4a5638aabb9590fd51ad8867d6a80c28138d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}